<td id="S3.T1.3.1.4.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">objects, find all objects with the same category</td></tr>
</table></td>
<td id="S3.T1.3.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">
